@prefix ex: <https://example.org/legal-kg/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

ex:Party a owl:Class .
ex:Person a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Party .
ex:Company a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Party .
ex:Payment a owl:Class .
ex:Statement a owl:Class .
ex:Claim a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Statement .
ex:ObservedFact a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Statement .
ex:Document a owl:Class .
ex:Evidence a owl:Class .
ex:DisputeMatter a owl:Class .

ex:payer a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Payment ; rdfs:range ex:Party .
ex:recipient a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Payment ; rdfs:range ex:Party .
ex:amount a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Payment ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
ex:currency a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Payment ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
ex:date a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Payment ; rdfs:range xsd:date .
ex:assertedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Claim ; rdfs:range ex:Party .
ex:concerns a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Statement .
ex:hasQualification a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Claim ; rdfs:range skos:Concept .
ex:claimKind a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Claim ; rdfs:range skos:Concept .
ex:claimAmount a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Claim ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
ex:derivedFrom a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Statement ; rdfs:range ex:Document .
ex:sourceText a owl:DatatypeProperty ; rdfs:domain ex:Statement ; rdfs:range xsd:string .
ex:label a owl:DatatypeProperty .
